lue":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T07:44:03-08:00","id":1292159,"title":"","content":"And we're getting new limited tiers! Hey you, how'd you like to name a character AND make a charm! Now you can, because Lunars are all about Both!<br /> <br /> So, I think those will be interesting. I wonder if the Artifact+Charm ones will go as quickly as the Artifact ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T08:18:04-08:00","id":1292170,"title":"","content":"I like that Laughing Monster is still a Staff style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T08:38:20-08:00","id":1292172,"title":"","content":"Cloud trapeze looks like it will be something that makes for a great control spell. Makes it so you can travel faster, carry more stuff, and get a nifty utility ability that costs no motes (though I guess the utility ability is less useful if you are playing in a desert or something).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver P